2026-08-27 05:04 Implemented in lib/API/Docker/API/Plugins.pm: list, privileges, install (POST /plugins/pull), inspect, remove, enable, disable, upgrade, push, configure (POST /plugins/{name}/set). 'Scaffolding only' paragraph removed. Fixture-free daemon-free tests in t/plugins.t (23 subtests), both files git-added. prove -lr t/ and dzil test green.

Contract verified against moby's swagger AND its plugin router/backend source, not deduced. Four places the reference is wrong or silent, all documented in the POD and pinned by tests:
- enable has NO default for timeout (strconv.Atoi on the raw value), so the parameter is sent unconditionally or every enable 400s.
- the list filter is 'enabled', not the documented 'enable', and the daemon validates names -> hard error. Noted on karr #24.
- X-Registry-Auth is read on /plugins/privileges and /plugins/{name}/push; the reference documents it on neither.
- remove writes no body, despite a documented Plugin response schema.

Podman serves NONE of /plugins (measured, 5.4.2/API 1.41) - the ticket's premise that it implements a subset is wrong. Documented in the class POD.

